Error [jet.MissingMoveMarker]: `env` cannot be moved from borrowed storage
  --> tests/ui/copy_out_carrier_owning_position.jet:14:20
    |
 14 |     wrapped := Val(env)
    |                    ^^^
 Why: `env` is a read or write parameter, so its caller keeps the value, and `Res` can't be copied into the binding `wrapped`
 Fix: Declare the parameter `env: &&Res` so the caller hands the value over
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0201

